  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Equation of hyperbola,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>44</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>44</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence, equation of conjugate axis will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and equation of transverse axis is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,</p><p>Now plotting the diagram of parabola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6c110ed4-e040-4cfc-b893-9c40e7c6d770-9894415.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 350px;\" /></p><p>Now from above diagram, the area of the bounded region is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>28</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>28</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
